:null},{"id":"d_nikke_viper_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_viper_01_14","text":"As you know, society's perception of Nikkes leaves something to be desired.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_viper_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_viper_01_15","text":"The same cannot be said, however, for the Big Three and the Central Government.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_viper_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_viper_01_16","text":"While there are limits to their generosity, most of the people in those organizations treat Nikkes as human beings.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_viper_01_17","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_viper_01_17","text":"Does that include Syuen?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_viper_01_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_viper_01_18","text":"Well... there are always exceptions. Anyway, that's not our main focus right now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_viper_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_viper_01_19","text":"Shady businesses have always taken advantage of Nikkes, but it's starting to become a serious problem.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_viper_01_20","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_viper_01_20","text":"Shady in what way?","jump":"d_nikke_viper_01_22","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_viper_01_21","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_viper_01_21","text":"Take advantage of? In what way?","jump":"d_nikke_viper_01_22","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_viper_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_viper_01_22","text":"The entertainment district has always operated with the tacit approval of the Central Government, but this place is different.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Backstreet_n","bgArt":"backstreet_n","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_viper_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_viper_01_23","text":"They've been stealing Nikkes who are working directly under the Central Government,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["idollflower"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_viper_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_viper_01_24","text":"and using them for more, shall we say... intimate acts.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_viper_01_25","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_viper_01_25","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CommanderRoom","bgArt":"commanderroom","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["shifty_c"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_viper_01_26","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_viper_01_26","text":"How come the Central Government isn't taking care of this themselves?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_viper_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_viper_01_27","text":"Some high-ranking officials are involved in all this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_viper_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_viper_01_28","text":"That's hampered any formal investigation. There are a lot of people who don't want the A.C.P.U. catching wind of this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_viper_01_29","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_viper_01_29","text":"So that's why they've asked me.","jump":"d_nikke_viper_01_31","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_viper_01_30","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_viper_01_30","text":"So that's why it's being kept so hush-hush.","jump":"d_nikke_viper_01_32","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_viper_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_viper_01_31","text":"Precisely. You can move independently without any interference from the Central Government.","jump":"d_nikke_viper_01_33","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_viper_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_viper_01_32","text":"Precisely. If we're not careful, they might sense something and dispose of any incriminating evidence.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_viper_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_viper_01_33","text":"That's why I've been asked to bring this operation to you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_viper_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_viper_01_34","text":"I should mention that although I'm coming off somewhat casual now, this is in fact an order from higher up, and should be regarded as an order.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_viper_01_35","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_viper_01_35","text":"Let me guess: Andersen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_viper_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_viper_01_36","text":"Yes. There's only one Deputy Chief who would issue such orders.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_viper_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_viper_01_37","text":"And you're the only one capable of carrying them out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_viper_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_viper_01_38","text":"This job requires someone not just with skills, but with determination.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,